# oracle: compute saed on a periodic 4x4x4 fcc Ni crystal (256 atoms, pair_style none), the Ewald slice of the zone axis 1 1 0 (manual spacing c 0.1 0.1 0.1, Kmax 0.85, dR_Ewald 0.1): fix ave/time writes the vector c_SAED (format %.15g, mode vector) at run 0
# oracle: native: b332f28 (installed lmp; compute saed is in the DIFFRACTION package of that binary)
# oracle-files: w134cp_saed_zone.txt
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=none filerel=1e-8
units           metal
boundary        p p p
lattice         fcc 3.52
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            * 58.71
pair_style      none
compute         SAED all saed 0.0251 Ni Kmax 0.85 Zone 1 1 0 c 0.1 0.1 0.1 dR_Ewald 0.1 manual
fix             1 all ave/time 1 1 1 c_SAED mode vector format " %.15g" file w134cp_saed_zone.txt
thermo_style    custom step pe
run             0
